    - target: {fileID: 831183410218012187, guid: 444719d241a145d409b8f57fe4918b6c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message.localizedTexts.Array.data[0].text
      value: "J\xE1 ouvi falar deste lugar. H\xE1 um samurai famoso por estas bandas
        que descansa numa ilha todas as tardes, \xE0 espera de um oponente \xE0 altura
        para reclamar a sua espada. Eu n\xE3o gosto de armas pequenas. Tenho o meu
        grande machado, por isso ele n\xE3o precisa de se preocupar comigo."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 831183410218012187, guid: 444719d241a145d409b8f57fe4918b6c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message.localizedTexts.Array.data[1].text
      value: I've heard of this place. There's a notorious samurai around these parts,
        who rests on a island every afternoon waiting for a worthy opponent to claim
        his sword. I don't like small weapons. Got my big axe, so he doesn't need
        to worry about me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
