    - target: {fileID: 2329102180128833955, guid: 444719d241a145d409b8f57fe4918b6c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message.localizedTexts.Array.data[0].text
      value: "Ainda n\xE3o consigo acreditar que as nossas galinhas foram sequestradas...
        por um urso solit\xE1rio. Fico contente que tenhas cuidado disso, irm\xE3o.
        Mas dev\xEDamos mesmo pensar em melhorar a seguran\xE7a do nosso galinheiro."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2329102180128833955, guid: 444719d241a145d409b8f57fe4918b6c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: message.localizedTexts.Array.data[1].text
      value: I still can't believe our chickens were kidnapped... by a lonely bear.
        I'm glad you took care of it, brother. But we should really consider improving
        our chicken coop security.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
