--- !u!114 &1574118694
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1574118692}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c8aa3f3cae44ad24590de72453d413b7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a82c20dd261c8e047a3db9d63c8acc69, type: 2}
  message: Ah... I remember my first illusionary wall... I was dancing with a bear
    in a town square and fell into a well... only it wasn't filled with water, but
    a secret cave filled with pirate chests brimming with gold. I was able to pay
    off my church debt from studies in painting, and even afford a new home for my
    father, who was still a farmer. You should have seen his expression when I told
    him he'd finally be able to own his own land and have servants after a lifetime
    of servitude. That must have been quite a sight, wouldn't you agree? Oh... I'm
    sorry, I can see you're in a hurry. I'll stop talking now!
  responses: []
