  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a82c20dd261c8e047a3db9d63c8acc69, type: 2}
  message: Ah, a newbie. Very well. The arena is where you'll fight waves of enemies
    to earn coins. To start, ring that bell over there. Fight through multiple rounds.
    If you survive all the rounds, you keep your coins. But be careful, if you lose
    or hit the arena's edge, you'll lose all your coins. It's a fun way to test your
    fighting skills. Go ahead! Try it out.
  responses: []
